"marked."
msgstr ""
"Dvacet čtyři planetárních hodin dne na jednom místě, s vyznačením aktuální "
"hodiny."

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Retrograde Status (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Retrográdní stav (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "retrograde"
msgstr "retrográdní"

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "mercury"
msgstr "rtuť"

#: blocks/retrograde/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "Whether one planet is retrograde right now, and when that changes."
msgstr ""
"Zda je právě teď nějaká planeta v retrográdním pohybu a kdy se to změní."

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Retrograde Planets (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Retrográdní planety (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "planets"
msgstr "planety"

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "All eight planets that station, and what each is doing today."
msgstr ""
"Všech osm planet, které se nacházejí v stacionárním bodě, a co každá z nich "
"dnes dělá."

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Rising Sign (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Vzestupné znamení (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "rising"
msgstr "stoupající"

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "ascendant"
msgstr "vzestupný"

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The rising sign with its chart ruler. Needs coordinates: the ascendant is the"
" horizon at a place."
msgstr ""
"Znamení ascendentu a jeho vládce. Potřebné souřadnice: ascendent představuje "
"horizont v daném místě."

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Solar Return (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Solární revoluce (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "solar return"
msgstr "solární revoluce"

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "birthday"
msgstr "narozeniny"

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "year ahead"
msgstr "příští rok"

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The chart of the moment the Sun returns to its birth position in a given "
"year, drawn into the page. Without a birth date it asks the visitor. Needs a "
"site key or an API key."
msgstr ""
"Horoskop okamžiku, kdy se Slunce v daném roce vrací na své místo při "
"narození, vykreslený přímo do stránky. Bez data narození se na něj "
"návštěvníka zeptá. Potřebuje klíč webu nebo klíč API."

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Synastry Compatibility (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Kompatibilita podle synastrie (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "synastry"
msgstr "synastrie"

#: blocks/synastry/block.json blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "love"
msgstr "milovat"

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Compatibility score and the cross-aspects behind it for two birth charts, "
"rendered into the page by api.astroway.info. No key needed."
msgstr ""
"Skóre kompatibility a související aspekty dvou horoskopů, zobrazené na této "
"stránce pomocí služby api.astroway.info. Legenda není nutná."

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Tarot Spread of the Day (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Výklad tarotu dne (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "spread"
msgstr "výklad"

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "celtic cross"
msgstr "keltský kříž"

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Three cards or the Celtic Cross, drawn once a day for this site, each card "
"read in its position. A visitor can draw again."
msgstr ""
"Tři karty nebo Keltský kříž, tažené jednou denně pro tento web; každá karta "
"vyložena ve své pozici. Návštěvník může vyložit znovu."

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Moon Transit Timeline (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Časová osa průchodů Měsíce (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "transit"
msgstr "tranzit"

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "week"
msgstr "týden"

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The next seven days of Moon ingresses, served by api.astroway.info as a "
"responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Přehled vstupů Měsíce na následujících sedm dní, poskytovaný serverem "
"api.astroway.info jako responzivní iframe."

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Transit Sky (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Transit Sky (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "sky"
msgstr "nebe"

#: blocks/transit/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Snapshot of the transiting planets' signs and degrees for a date, served by "
"api.astroway.info as a responsive iframe."
msgstr ""
"Přehled znamení a stupňů tranzitujících planet k danému datu, poskytovaný "
"službou api.astroway.info jako responzivní iframe."

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Horoscope for the Week (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Týdenní horoskop (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "weekly"
msgstr "týdně"

#: blocks/weekly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Horoscope for the current week, anchored to Monday, rendered into the page as"
" text."
msgstr ""
"Horoskop na tento týden, počínaje pondělím, zobrazený na stránce ve formě "
"textu."

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Horoscope for the Year (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Roční horoskop (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "yearly"
msgstr "ročně"

#: blocks/yearly-horoscope/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "The year ahead for one zodiac sign."
msgstr "Co přinese nadcházející rok pro jedno znamení zvěrokruhu."

#: blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Zodiac Compatibility (AstroWay)"
msgstr "Kompatibilita znamení zvěrokruhu (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "How two zodiac signs read together."
msgstr "Jak se k sobě hodí dvě znamení zvěrokruhu."

